yle=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">#3D6FE8</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Coolant, vacuum breaches, crushers</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Neutral hull</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">#37474F</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Everything else</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 data-chunk-id=\"82525126-917b-4e4b-9417-88f2c0eadd6e\" style=\"color:#0d47a1;margin-top:18px\">Concept art</h2>\n<p data-chunk-id=\"f7dd1947-5f16-402a-ad88-e7574e0f961a\">Reference boards live in this section. Each image is captioned with the\nsector it belongs to and the date it was approved.</p>",
